    "name": "Iona's Island",
    "steam_appid": 3674070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/0f90ab51fa703da32b725aee9cb0b81c.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/d0913c9a85079a52b4511cc1e69bde1d.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/d0913c9a85079a52b4511cc1e69bde1d.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/d0913c9a85079a52b4511cc1e69bde1d.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the young Leshen, Iona, on a breathtaking floating island nestled upon the ancient shell of Heimsskjald, the colossal sea turtle! This once-lively land, teeming with unique inhabitants, now calls for Iona\u2019s magical abilities to transform it back into the paradise oasis it was destined to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time has come again for the spirit island to be reborn. As Iona, you awaken to find your island home in disarray. Your help is needed to cleanse the land, rekindle its vibrant life, and repopulate it with a community of whimsical beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Ancient Magic - relearn and expand Iona\u2019s repertoire of magical abilities. You\u2019ll learn spells as you unlock this island\u2019s mysteries to help you grow, shrink, and mold the island with your mind\u2019s eye. Your growing power is key to the island's restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture and Customize Your Island. Actively shape the environment. With Iona\u2019s ancient magic, you\u2019ll be able to populate the island with all sorts of flora, useful stones and even touch the stars. Your creativity directly impacts the island's beauty and appeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/b2c8a7f8ebee01713b73c1661a6c7c14.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a Fantastical Cast: Meet and interact with a diverse array of unique island residents. Each resident has their own personality, story and quests that need your help to restore their part of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/17dc7be3b16e7ab497534dbef5dd303c.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and Uncover Secrets: Traverse the varied landscapes of Heimsskjald's back. You\u2019ll uncover hidden caves, creatures brave and timid, mystical mermaids and uncover remnants of old.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore Global Balance: Your whimsical efforts contribute to restoring harmony in the world. Witness the tangible effects of your actions as the island transforms from desolate to dazzling in this cozy sandbox style adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/9a2b34faed40639f71483272c23d67f6.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbf299eedf425145776b7c108f8114b0.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbf299eedf425145776b7c108f8114b0.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbf299eedf425145776b7c108f8114b0.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the Spirit Realm: Go beyond the humble island roots and touch the spirit realm... You\u2019ll be able to go beyond the Island wonders and touch the stars through the will of Heimsskjald.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/0f90ab51fa703da32b725aee9cb0b81c.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/d0913c9a85079a52b4511cc1e69bde1d.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/d0913c9a85079a52b4511cc1e69bde1d.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/d0913c9a85079a52b4511cc1e69bde1d.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the young Leshen, Iona, on a breathtaking floating island nestled upon the ancient shell of Heimsskjald, the colossal sea turtle! This once-lively land, teeming with unique inhabitants, now calls for Iona\u2019s magical abilities to transform it back into the paradise oasis it was destined to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time has come again for the spirit island to be reborn. As Iona, you awaken to find your island home in disarray. Your help is needed to cleanse the land, rekindle its vibrant life, and repopulate it with a community of whimsical beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Ancient Magic - relearn and expand Iona\u2019s repertoire of magical abilities. You\u2019ll learn spells as you unlock this island\u2019s mysteries to help you grow, shrink, and mold the island with your mind\u2019s eye. Your growing power is key to the island's restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture and Customize Your Island. Actively shape the environment. With Iona\u2019s ancient magic, you\u2019ll be able to populate the island with all sorts of flora, useful stones and even touch the stars. Your creativity directly impacts the island's beauty and appeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/b2c8a7f8ebee01713b73c1661a6c7c14.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a Fantastical Cast: Meet and interact with a diverse array of unique island residents. Each resident has their own personality, story and quests that need your help to restore their part of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/17dc7be3b16e7ab497534dbef5dd303c.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and Uncover Secrets: Traverse the varied landscapes of Heimsskjald's back. You\u2019ll uncover hidden caves, creatures brave and timid, mystical mermaids and uncover remnants of old.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore Global Balance: Your whimsical efforts contribute to restoring harmony in the world. Witness the tangible effects of your actions as the island transforms from desolate to dazzling in this cozy sandbox style adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/9a2b34faed40639f71483272c23d67f6.avif?t=1753041995\" data-has-big width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbf299eedf425145776b7c108f8114b0.poster.avif?t=1753041995\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbf299eedf425145776b7c108f8114b0.webm?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbf299eedf425145776b7c108f8114b0.mp4?t=1753041995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the Spirit Realm: Go beyond the humble island roots and touch the spirit realm... You\u2019ll be able to go beyond the Island wonders and touch the stars through the will of Heimsskjald.</p>",
